tpm 1
boot power
# select-card: a blank card in port 1, none in port 2. Option mode (as select-option), the card
# rows. Options, Load: Circle at the port prompt; Load from port 1 ("no data", 120 frames, back
# to the prompt); port 2 (no card); Circle. Options, Save to port 1: no file, room on the card,
# the file is created with the whole persistent block. Rankings, Save to port 1: the file is
# there, overwrite? Cross on No (back to the prompt); port 1 again, Circle at the question;
# port 1 again, Left to Yes, Cross: the rankings are written into the file. Rankings, Load from
# port 1; Options, Load from port 1; Options, Save to port 2 (no card). Exit; Down, Cross,
# Cross: Edit (SELECT exits to EDIT.EXE, not traced).
